   "hash": "5a9daf9ac8c54bdd",
   "does": "Back-publishes archived workout sessions to Apple Health: requires HealthKit + workout write auth; skips entirely when the workout set watermark (count-newestDate) matches the stored one; otherwise logs denied optional types and serially exports each eligible session (claim, retrieve, needsBackfill, export+stamp, 250 ms pacing), storing the watermark only when no session failed. Returns (exported, skipped, failed). Called from EmuquApp.swift:561 on foreground.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Collection/HealthKitManager.swift::var HealthKitManager.workoutWriteAuthorized",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Collection/HealthKitManager.swift::func HealthKitManager.backfillWatermark(_:)",
